A '''sulfur slab''' is a decorative [[slab]] variant of [[sulfur]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Sulfur slabs drop as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, it drops nothing.
{{Breaking row|Sulfur Slab|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

